    <defName>RM_SpunstoneBonding</defName>
    <label>spunstone bonding</label>
    <description>Floatstone is strong the way a woven thing is strong: its glass threads hand strain to one another. Learn to lay it in the grain and it can brace a gravship's frame for almost no weight.</description>
